  title: "The 1.5 \xB0C target"
  body: "Under the Paris Agreement, countries aim to keep global warming within 1.5
    \xB0C of pre-industrial times, before the late 1800s. The number is the long-term
    rise of the whole Earth's average temperature, not one hot day or one place.
    The temperature bar in this game tracks that limit."
